{
  "title": "Hearty Bitter Spanish Mushrooms Pulpo A La Gallega",
  "description": "A bitter and crumbly Spanish dish featuring fresh thyme, perfect for a date night, this vegetarian friendly recipe is a twist on the traditional pulpo a la gallega, served in a stone bowl dolsot.",
